beault, and Josip Maras&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Edition<\/strong>: 2nd Edition, 2016&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Publisher:<\/strong>&nbsp;Manning Publications<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Summary<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are looking for good&nbsp;web development&nbsp;books&nbsp;2026&nbsp;to become a JavaScript Ninja and enhance your skills further, then this is the right pick for you. While most books focus on the basics of JavaScript, this book goes beyond the fundamentals of JS and covers more difficult concepts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The book is authored by three writers &#8211; <\/strong>John Resig, Bear Bibeault, and Josip Maras. It includes practical examples to illustrate core concepts and techniques, helping readers master key JS concepts, such as objects, functions, prototypes, closures, and promises.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It will teach you how to write effective code and how to avoid JavaScript application pitfalls. You will also learn how to manage asynchronous codes. It also explains concepts like ES6 and ES7.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Highlights<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Best for learners who are familiar with JS and want to enhance their knowledge and skills.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">16. Responsive Web Design with HTML5 and CSS, 5th Edition \u2014 Ben Frain<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"402\" height=\"497\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/responsive-web-design-with-html5-css.webp\" alt=\"Responsive Web Design with HTML5 and CSS, 5th Edition \u2014 Ben Frain\" class=\"wp-image-21223\" style=\"width:284px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/responsive-web-design-with-html5-css.webp 402w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog